      },
      {
        "text": "Blood Sea Ancestor left nine true inheritances of Gu Immortal level: blood skull Gu, blood handprint Gu, blood qi Gu, blood sweat Gu, menses blood Gu, blood shadow Gu, blood battle Gu, blood deity Gu, and the method to raise and enslave the ancient desolate beast violent blood dragon bat. Blood battle Gu’s true inheritance was by chance destroyed by an immemorial desolate beast. After Giant Sun Immortal Venerable revived, Earth Extremity Gan Ni refined Immortal Gu for him and obtained several blood path Immortal Gu, among them blood battle Immortal Gu.",
